title: Panels open as cards on the canvas, several at once on either side, and close one by one; the files stay docked and Ctrl+B hides them
folders: git-changes
limit: 60
forbid-log: WARN.*script

wait 3000
fit
wait 800
mark a-files-docked-nothing-floating
wait 400
right symbols
wait 700
mark b-one-card
wait 400
left changes
wait 400
left search
wait 700
mark c-three-cards
wait 400
move changes right
wait 700
mark d-changes-on-the-right-side
wait 400
left help
wait 700
mark e-help-too
wait 400
left none
wait 700
mark f-files-hidden-right-cards-stay
wait 400
left files
right none
wait 700
mark g-only-files
wait 400
quit
